<title>USA: Kelly Services Inc Q3 net edges higher.</title>
<headline>Kelly Services Inc Q3 net edges higher.</headline>
<dateline>TROY, Mich. 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third Quarter*   Nine Months*</p>
<p>				 1996     1995	1996	 1995</p>
<p>				     (In 000's except per share data)</p>
<p> Sales of services    $873,242 $698,453 $2,411,435 $1,971,555</p>
<p> Costs and expenses    837,744  667,093  2,327,993  1,897,593</p>
<p> Earnings -- operations 35,498   31,360     83,442     73,962</p>
<p> Interest income	     822    1,798	3,509	6,508</p>
<p> Earnings before taxes  36,320   33,158     86,951     80,470</p>
<p> Income taxes	     14,890   12,785     35,170     31,175</p>
<p> Net earnings	     21,430   20,373     51,781     49,295</p>
<p> Earnings per share	 0.56     0.54	 1.36	 1.30</p>
<p> Avg Class A and B shrs 38,057   38,005     38,038     37,986</p>
<p>* The 13- and 39-week periods ended September 29, 1996 and October 1, 1995.</p>
